@@@!atrep-exo
@=at-djot=>dj

@@/ Djot export for the at-djot syntax mapper. The canonical
@@/ subset is a fixed point of export then import.

@%
\ \\
_ \_
* \*
` \`
%@

@-> *document
@(grammata)
>-@

@-> *paragraph
@(grammata)

>-@

@-> ><
<@(grammata)>
>-@

@-> *solo #
# @(grammata)
>-@

@-> *solo ##
## @(grammata)
>-@

@-> *solo ###
### @(grammata)
>-@

@-> *solo ####
#### @(grammata)
>-@

@-> *solo #####
##### @(grammata)
>-@

@-> *solo ######
###### @(grammata)
>-@

@-> _
_@(grammata)_
>-@

@-> *
*@(grammata)*
>-@

@-> >
> @(grammata:> )
>-@

@-> -
- @(grammata)
>-@

@-> .
@(taxis). @(grammata)
>-@

@-> *verbatim
```@[@(genoses)]@
@((content))
```

>-@

@-> *verbatim-inline
`@((content))`
>-@

@-> *media
![](@((param)))
>-@

@-> *onym-anchor
{#@(onym)}
>-@
